    <item>
      <title>Russia Diesel Deal 'Not the Right Policy,' Says Rep. Don Beyer</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-14/russia-diesel-deal-not-the-right-policy-says-beyer-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">62b4f10b3db5500afd217244</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:03:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Democrat Representative from Virginia Don Beyer said that President Trump's deal to allow Russian oil back on to the global market is 'not the right policy' to meaningfully bring diesel costs down for Americans and it flies in the face of the Russia sanctions bill recently passed by lawmakers. Beyer also discussed what he expects from the midterm elections in Virginia as high numbers of voters head to the polls to cast their ballots early. Beyer said that the impact of DOGE cuts on federal workers has pushed Virginians out to vote. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
